Cyberbullying & Harassment Safety Portal

Prerequisites
1. Python 3.10+ (Python 3.12 recommended)
2. Node.js 18+ & npm
3. MongoDB (Running on default port `27017`)


🟢 1ST TIME (First Time Setup & Run)
You need to install dependencies for both Python and Node.js

🖥️ Terminal 1 (Backend)
    cd "E:\cyberbullying_safety_system"
    python -m pip install -r backend\requirements.txt
    python run_backend.py

🖥️ Terminal 2 (Frontend)
    cd "E:\cyberbullying_safety_system - Copy\frontend"
    npm install
    npm run dev

---

2ND TIME ONWARDS (Daily / Regular Run)
No need to install anything. Directly start the servers.

🖥️ Terminal 1 (Backend)
    python run_backend.py

🖥️ Terminal 2 (Frontend)
    cd frontend
    npm run dev
